> Paul Barbu Gh. wrote:
> > After 9 Nov 2011 kernel update to 3.1.0-4 in ArchLinux I get no sound
> > output(headphones and speakers), I checked alsamixer and pavucontrol and
> > everything seems OK.
> 
> Please get the contents of /proc/asound/card0/codec* with the old and
> new kernels, and post it to <alsa-devel@alsa-project.org>.

Try 3.1.1 kernel.  The bug with ALC861 & co should have been fixed.

If the problem is still present, at best, take alsa-info.sh outputs
(run with --no-upload option) on both working and non-working kernels,
and attach the outputs.  This will contain more comprehensive
information.


